\f0\fs24 \cf0 Here's an honest end-to-end trace of exactly what happens at each step \'97 and it\
  caught two things in my earlier runbook that were wrong. No code run; this is a\
  walkthrough against the actual code.\
\
  Step-by-step dry read\
\
  1. docker-compose up -d\
  - ClickHouse starts: ports 9000 (native) + 8123 (HTTP), database edr, password\
  bastion123\
  - Grafana starts: port 3000, admin/admin, datasource pre-provisioned to\
  clickhouse:8123 / db edr (matches the compose password) \uc0\u10003 \
  \
  2. go run ./cmd/server (with CLICKHOUSE_DSN exported)\
  - Connects + pings ClickHouse \uc0\u8594  connected to ClickHouse\
  - Loads certs/ca-cert.pem + server-cert.pem/key \uc0\u8594  if any cert missing, hard\
  Fatalf (yours are committed, so fine)\
  - Creates all 5 tables: response_commands, hosts, process_events, network_events,\
  alerts \uc0\u8592  the fix that makes dashboards work\
  - gRPC listening :50051 (mTLS), REST :8080\
  - Background goroutine marks hosts OFFLINE after 30s idle\
\
  3. go run ./cmd/real_agent --loop\
  - mTLS dial with agent-cert.pem (CN = agent-01) \uc0\u8594  handshake succeeds against the\
  server's RequireAndVerifyClientCert \uc0\u10003  \
  - Background heartbeat loop (every 10s): sends HeartbeatEvent\{AgentId: \
  os.Hostname()\} + polls REST\
  - Main loop (every 10s): fires the 4-event attack chain via unary\
  SendEvent/SendNetworkEvent\
\
